  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Xenergi Gas Gathering and Processing Project, through GR2 Engineering Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant to Xenergi Limited funds a feasibility study to assess the feasibility of expansion and deployment of a gas gathering and processing project in the Niger Delta region of Nigeria. The project will support the goals of Nigeria&apos;s Economic Recovery and Growth Plan by supporting Nigeria&apos;s diversification of its energy industry. The project will also help decrease the negative environmental, social, and economic impacts of gas flaring and re-injection.</narrative>
  </description>
